{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144765,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Figure X. ROC Curves Under Frozen Cross-Dataset Transfer With the Frozen Operating Points\nNote. Fixed-recipe three-seed ensembles. Markers show each model’s operating point at its frozen source-validation threshold. Numbers are ROC-AUC (top to bottom: SwinFusion++, Swin-B, Video Swin-B). The dashed diagonal marks chance. Markers near the origin overlap because almost no target videos were flagged as fake. Abbreviations as in the transfer ROC-AUC heatmap."}}
]
